WEBVTT

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:05.980
64th Suginami 
<b>Ballet Festival</b>

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:05.980
Which one's Nanako?

00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:09.120
That one, second from the right.

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:11.990
Huh? They changed formation...

00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:15.920
It's over.

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:16.630
Let's go.

00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:19.120
Jumpei, wake up.

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:22.120
<i>Next, we have a special program.</i>

00:01:39.740 --> 00:01:40.870
<i>Tingle...</i>

00:01:48.020 --> 00:01:49.210
<i>Sparkle...</i>

00:01:51.360 --> 00:01:53.050
<i>Boom!</i>

00:01:54.330 --> 00:01:55.810
<i>The stars...</i>

00:01:55.810 --> 00:01:56.980
<i>exploded!</i>

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:32.100
Act 1: "There's No Way I'm Doing That Ballet Thing!"

00:03:32.410 --> 00:03:34.060
Let's do this! I'm serious!

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:43.820
If you don't stop me from stepping in,
 you'll get hit with a "bam!"

00:03:43.820 --> 00:03:46.290
Whoa, that was fast! Jeet Kune Do!

00:03:45.380 --> 00:03:46.850
Thanks, thanks.

00:03:46.290 --> 00:03:48.000
You're amazing, Jumpei!

00:03:48.580 --> 00:03:49.860
You should join us!

00:03:49.860 --> 00:03:52.960
It's fun at Uncle Mioka's dojo!

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:55.550
No way. It's in Meguro, right?

00:03:55.550 --> 00:03:57.060
That's too far!

00:04:00.670 --> 00:04:02.670
Whoa!

00:04:02.670 --> 00:04:03.950
Was that a flying kick?

00:04:03.950 --> 00:04:05.140
Is that Jeet Kune Do?

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:05.930
That's crazy!

00:04:05.930 --> 00:04:08.180
Murao Jumpei!

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:09.960
Hurry up and get in your place!

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:10.560
Choral Competition

00:04:09.960 --> 00:04:12.310
We need to start practice!

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:12.310
Choral Competition 
The Theme for Class 2-2 is "Unity"

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:14.900
I've got club stuff.

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:16.460
Hey!

00:04:28.020 --> 00:04:31.110
<i>Godai Miyako's... sound.</i>

00:04:34.160 --> 00:04:35.420
Ready, and...

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:39.760
Hidden in the shadows 
of a forest of beech trees

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:42.140
Jumpei's singing!

00:04:39.760 --> 00:04:43.680
There is the rustle and murmur of a party

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:48.180
Torches flicker, their flames dancing

00:04:46.780 --> 00:04:50.470
<i>Kodai Miyako moved here just 
when we became second-years.</i>

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:50.470
Leaves spread out around colorful figures

00:04:51.820 --> 00:04:55.070
<i>For some reason, the way 
she plays piano intrigues me.</i>

00:04:57.940 --> 00:04:59.440
<b>My Room</b>

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:03.470
<b>Mito Yukino</b>

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:04.090
<b>Fukiishi Kazuko</b>

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:04.450
<b>Invited by Brute Lee</b>

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:04.450
<b>Director
 Takehara Naoto</b>

00:05:01.590 --> 00:05:07.970
Go-da-i... Mi-ya-ko...

00:05:01.680 --> 00:05:04.450
<b>Stunt Coordinator
 Murao Ippeita</b>

00:05:02.380 --> 00:05:04.450
<b>Starring Natsuji Akio</b>

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:11.200
What is it? Why am I intrigued?

00:05:11.690 --> 00:05:13.530
Is it her mole?

00:05:13.530 --> 00:05:14.710
It's like...

00:05:16.160 --> 00:05:18.730
the sound of a premonition...

00:05:20.100 --> 00:05:21.470
What do you want, Nee-chan?!

00:05:21.470 --> 00:05:22.770
Knock first!

00:05:22.770 --> 00:05:25.940
This is Dad's room, not yours.

00:05:25.940 --> 00:05:29.020
Also, I think Mom wants to 
throw away that ballet barre.

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:31.490
What do you think?

00:05:32.410 --> 00:05:33.110
Huh?

00:05:33.470 --> 00:05:36.290
Why are you asking me? It's yours, isn't it?

00:05:36.290 --> 00:05:38.440
But you wanted to do ballet, didn't you?

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:40.480
That was forever ago!

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:42.730
It's like my dark past!

00:05:42.730 --> 00:05:45.330
Now I'm glad I didn't just 
charge right into ballet classes!

00:05:45.330 --> 00:05:47.490
That would've been so lame for a boy!

00:05:49.420 --> 00:05:52.680
You quit ballet after you started 
playing basketball, right?

00:05:52.680 --> 00:05:54.240
Just throw it out.

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:58.040
Oh? Fine, I'll tell Mom that.

00:06:07.980 --> 00:06:09.220
<i>Tingle...</i>

00:06:09.870 --> 00:06:11.220
<i>Sparkle...</i>

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:14.840
<i>Boom!</i>

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:18.730
If you're gonna do ballet,

00:06:18.730 --> 00:06:20.600
you gotta stretch first.

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:26.110
Do you want to do ballet, too, Jumpei?

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:28.590
What? Boys can do it, too?!

00:06:28.590 --> 00:06:31.260
I'll call them, and if they say 
boys can join, then you can.

00:06:31.260 --> 00:06:31.850
I'll do it!

00:06:31.850 --> 00:06:32.370
What?

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:35.240
You're already taking piano lessons,

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:38.340
and you're mistaken for a girl 
often enough as it is.

00:06:38.670 --> 00:06:42.040
How about something more 
manly, like Jeet Kune Do?

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:44.170
My friend does it, and—

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:15.240
All right, fine. Give it a shot.

00:07:17.740 --> 00:07:19.250
<b>Ballet Studio</b>

00:07:18.570 --> 00:07:19.590
Isn't it great?

00:07:19.590 --> 00:07:21.180
Boys can join, too.

00:07:21.180 --> 00:07:22.000
Yeah!

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:23.460
Hey, it's Jumpei!

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:24.670
Hyou-chan!

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:26.170
What're you doing?

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:28.810
Oh, Hyou-chan, are you boys on 
your way back from soccer?

00:07:29.310 --> 00:07:30.860
Look at those tight tights!

00:07:30.860 --> 00:07:32.830
Isn't this a ballet school?

00:07:32.830 --> 00:07:36.810
Huh? Jumpei, are you always spinning 
around 'cause you take ballet?

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:38.340
You're a boy, though.

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:42.690
Weirdo! Are you a girl or something?!

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:44.690
<i>...more manly...</i>

00:07:46.850 --> 00:07:48.940
J-Jumpei!

00:07:47.290 --> 00:07:48.940
Jumko got mad!

00:07:49.880 --> 00:07:53.910
Goodness, they were just 
teasing you a little.

00:07:55.100 --> 00:07:57.800
I'm gonna do ballet...

00:07:59.510 --> 00:08:00.510
Okay.

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:06.290
Yes, this is Murao.

00:08:06.290 --> 00:08:07.420
Huh?

00:08:09.450 --> 00:08:11.310
It was a heart attack?

00:08:11.560 --> 00:08:13.300
He was still so young...

00:08:17.130 --> 00:08:18.280
Jumpei,

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:20.300
long time no see.

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:22.570
Uncle Mioka...

00:08:22.570 --> 00:08:23.980
From now on,

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:27.060
you need to protect your 
big sister and your mom.

00:08:27.500 --> 00:08:29.190
You're the man of the house now.

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:34.070
<b>Stunt Coordinator: 
Murao Ippeita</b>

00:08:34.990 --> 00:08:37.570
Manly...

00:08:52.290 --> 00:08:56.410
<i>"Not manly" equals "not cool"...</i>

00:08:57.510 --> 00:09:00.420
<i>I want... to be cool...</i>

00:09:15.510 --> 00:09:17.460
This is stupid!

00:09:18.090 --> 00:09:20.780
Crap, I'm gonna be late 
for Jeet Kune Do again!

00:09:32.260 --> 00:09:34.150
There you are, Murao Jumpei!

00:09:34.610 --> 00:09:35.880
<i>Wh-What?</i>

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:40.440
Oh, good. I don't know my way around 
that well yet, so I wasn't sure...

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:38.540
<i>Did she come here to see </i>me<i>?</i>

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:40.880
<i>I-Is she...</i>

00:09:40.880 --> 00:09:42.760
<i>here to confess her feelings for me?!</i>

00:09:42.760 --> 00:09:45.520
There's something I want you to try for me.

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:46.770
Yes, ma'am!

00:09:47.260 --> 00:09:48.150
Huh?

00:09:48.570 --> 00:09:49.820
T-Try?

00:09:49.820 --> 00:09:53.400
Y'know, that Jeet Kune Do thing 
you did today. The flying kick?

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:54.690
Try doing it for me.

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:56.530
Huh? Why?

00:09:57.780 --> 00:10:01.990
<i>It's like, when I saw that flying kick...</i>

00:10:02.810 --> 00:10:05.770
<i>You... You...</i>

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:08.920
Okay! Here I go!

00:10:14.540 --> 00:10:15.800
Like that?

00:10:17.260 --> 00:10:19.200
That's not as good as the one you did before.

00:10:19.200 --> 00:10:19.760
Huh?!

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:22.470
That was a ballet jump, wasn't it?

00:10:22.750 --> 00:10:24.140
A 540.

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:27.060
Wh-What're you talking about?

00:10:37.800 --> 00:10:41.370
This is closer to a proper 540, Murao.

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:43.490
<i>H-Her panties...</i>

00:10:44.640 --> 00:10:47.610
Hey, let's do ballet together!

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:52.330
<b>Godai Ballet Studio</b>

00:10:50.810 --> 00:10:52.330
This is the Godai Ballet Studio.

00:10:52.780 --> 00:10:56.340
It just opened in February, after my 
mom left to start her own studio.

00:10:56.630 --> 00:10:59.090
There still aren't very 
many students, though.

00:10:59.090 --> 00:11:01.750
Oh, I live upstairs.

00:11:01.750 --> 00:11:02.470
<i>Huh?!</i>

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:05.970
<i>I got distracted by her panties 
and followed her here...</i>

00:11:05.970 --> 00:11:08.850
U-Um, Godai-san,

00:11:09.250 --> 00:11:10.850
I'm not planning on doing ballet—

00:11:13.530 --> 00:11:14.610
Isn't it nice?

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:16.610
It's still new.

00:11:21.340 --> 00:11:22.810
<i>In a place like this,</i>

00:11:22.810 --> 00:11:26.070
<i>no matter how much I turn or jump...</i>

00:11:26.070 --> 00:11:28.080
Where do you take lessons, Murao?

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:29.980
I'm not taking lessons!

00:11:29.980 --> 00:11:30.790
Godai-san,

00:11:31.060 --> 00:11:33.170
I think you're getting the wrong idea.

00:11:33.620 --> 00:11:34.800
I mean, ballet?

00:11:35.080 --> 00:11:36.800
I'm a guy, you know.

00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:38.920
Besides, I'm totally devoted to Jeet Kune Do!

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:40.430
Why are you lying?

00:11:40.430 --> 00:11:43.920
That 540 you did is a ballet technique.

00:11:45.000 --> 00:11:46.180
Luou-kun?

00:11:48.200 --> 00:11:49.560
Oh, Mom!

00:11:49.560 --> 00:11:52.690
<i>"Luou-kun"? I feel like I've 
heard that name before...</i>

00:11:55.240 --> 00:11:56.270
Who's that?

00:11:56.270 --> 00:11:59.320
<i>Nah, I guess she's just a cranky old hag.</i>

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:01.530
This is Murao Jumpei-kun. He's in my class.

00:12:01.530 --> 00:12:03.170
He wants to take ballet lessons!

00:12:03.170 --> 00:12:03.900
Wait!

00:12:03.900 --> 00:12:05.020
He's amazing!

00:12:05.020 --> 00:12:07.810
He can do a 540 even though 
he's never taken ballet before!

00:12:07.810 --> 00:12:09.040
What're you talking about?!

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:10.740
There's no way I'm doing that ballet thing!

00:12:10.740 --> 00:12:11.620
He's a prodigy!

00:12:11.620 --> 00:12:13.290
I really think so!

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:16.130
You know, for the dance 
federation's fall festival,

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:18.570
we'd stand out more if
 we had a talented boy,

00:12:18.570 --> 00:12:21.420
and besides, I want to try a pas de deux!

00:12:21.420 --> 00:12:22.520
<i>"Pas"?!</i>

00:12:22.520 --> 00:12:25.140
<i>If I remember right, that's when 
a guy and girl dance together!</i>

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:27.640
<i>She wants to dance with me?!</i>

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:30.640
<i>She likes me for sure!</i>

00:12:31.340 --> 00:12:33.130
Huh? "Prodigy"?

00:12:33.130 --> 00:12:34.270
Ridiculous.

00:12:34.270 --> 00:12:37.160
Jumpei-kun, you're a second-year 
in middle school, right?

00:12:37.160 --> 00:12:39.470
So you're, what, 13? 14?

00:12:39.470 --> 00:12:41.990
Even if you start ballet now, it's too late.

00:12:42.410 --> 00:12:45.390
You need to have started 
by the time you were ten.

00:12:45.390 --> 00:12:49.450
If you didn't, you're already 
outside the scope of "prodigy."

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:53.870
Besides, I'm not interested in teaching 
anyone who calls it "that ballet thing."

00:12:54.440 --> 00:12:57.130
Miyako, we're starting class, 
so send him home.

00:12:57.130 --> 00:12:58.600
But, Mom—

00:12:59.540 --> 00:13:01.550
That ballet thing...

00:13:01.550 --> 00:13:03.440
is easy!

00:13:04.590 --> 00:13:05.770
So high!

00:13:10.960 --> 00:13:12.220
<i>I knew it!</i>

00:13:13.230 --> 00:13:15.030
<i>I can go all-out here!</i>

00:13:15.620 --> 00:13:16.530
<i>Hop and...</i>

00:13:17.190 --> 00:13:18.360
<i>Leap!</i>

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:26.240
<i>Turn, turn...</i>

00:13:26.670 --> 00:13:28.900
<i>Boom!</i>

00:13:37.180 --> 00:13:40.460
<i>Whoa, I know this...</i>

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:42.050
<i>This feeling!</i>

00:13:51.980 --> 00:13:53.560
That's not ballet.

00:14:01.490 --> 00:14:02.470
Murao!

00:14:02.930 --> 00:14:04.340
Wait, Murao!

00:14:04.340 --> 00:14:07.500
Hey, wait up, Murao!

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:17.580
Oh, you're still awake?

00:14:18.280 --> 00:14:19.460
Um, Mom...

00:14:19.930 --> 00:14:21.880
Is Murao really that bad?

00:14:23.510 --> 00:14:25.430
His <i>Don Quixote</i>...

00:14:26.110 --> 00:14:28.630
It's true that it was messy in places,

00:14:29.130 --> 00:14:30.650
but it was like, "Whoosh!"

00:14:31.030 --> 00:14:33.640
Like a gust of wind...

00:14:34.080 --> 00:14:36.390
Was it just me? What did you think?

00:14:37.590 --> 00:14:40.760
Well, he needs to come on his own tomorrow.

00:14:40.760 --> 00:14:42.520
If he doesn't show up, that's that.

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:43.450
Huh?

00:14:43.450 --> 00:14:46.280
Come on, not getting enough 
sleep will stunt your growth.

00:14:46.650 --> 00:14:47.900
Hurry up and go to bed.

00:14:47.900 --> 00:14:49.320
What the heck?

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:51.120
Another school's going to poach him!

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:52.910
Hah! That damn brat?

00:15:00.030 --> 00:15:01.790
That damn brat...

00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:06.700
After seeing that, of course 
you wouldn't be able to sleep.

00:15:09.880 --> 00:15:11.890
Luou, are you awake?

00:15:14.810 --> 00:15:16.390
The key to the studio...

00:15:30.350 --> 00:15:32.610
Can you get your bellybutton 
to touch the floor?

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:36.030
Good, good! Make sure to point your toes.

00:15:36.030 --> 00:15:40.250
Sensei! There's a weird boy here.

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:42.750
Should we call the police?

00:15:43.630 --> 00:15:44.720
Hey, old lady!

00:15:45.010 --> 00:15:47.250
I'm the embodiment of athletic ability!

00:15:48.700 --> 00:15:50.470
What's wrong with my dancing?!

00:15:51.640 --> 00:15:53.470
You came here to practice, right?

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:55.050
N-No, I didn't!

00:15:55.050 --> 00:15:57.580
What you showed me before was a bit sudden.

00:15:57.580 --> 00:15:59.420
This time, show me what you can really do.

00:15:59.420 --> 00:16:01.560
Don't you mean "<i>Please</i> show me,"
 you freakin' old lady?!

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:03.810
Stop calling me "old lady," you damn brat!

00:16:04.130 --> 00:16:07.580
Okay, everyone! This boy 
says he's going to dance.

00:16:07.580 --> 00:16:09.570
Aw, I don't wanna watch that!

00:16:11.730 --> 00:16:14.110
<i>Fine, I'll show you...</i>

00:16:14.110 --> 00:16:18.120
<i>my </i>Don Quixote<i> that I spent 
all night studying!</i>

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:22.120
Let's see...

00:16:26.630 --> 00:16:28.130
One, two, th—

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:29.500
Stop!

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:31.880
Your elbow! Back! Fingertips! Toes!

00:16:30.320 --> 00:16:31.880
Ow!

00:16:31.880 --> 00:16:33.260
Knees! Pay attention!

00:16:34.560 --> 00:16:36.890
You can't even stand properly.

00:16:37.720 --> 00:16:40.970
More! More, more, more, more! 
Lengthen your spine more!

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:43.040
Like this! Taller!

00:16:43.040 --> 00:16:45.180
Huh? You gotta stand straight 
and pull yourself up, right?

00:16:45.180 --> 00:16:45.900
I saw online—

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:47.860
Try exhaling and making your stomach hollow.

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:52.360
Yes, that's good enough for the front.

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:54.580
Huh?! Really, old lady?!

00:16:54.580 --> 00:16:56.470
You were sticking your chest out too much.

00:16:56.470 --> 00:16:58.810
Trying focusing on your back.

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:03.510
Pretend there's someone holding you 
below your navel and behind your neck.

00:17:03.510 --> 00:17:05.680
Open your shoulders a little more.

00:17:05.680 --> 00:17:06.660
Good.

00:17:06.660 --> 00:17:11.000
Then grow taller, and taller, 
and taller, and taller...

00:17:11.270 --> 00:17:12.080
Good.

00:17:12.080 --> 00:17:15.380
Now feel yourself getting pulled higher, 
until you're on your tiptoes,

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:16.630
and press into the floor.

00:17:16.630 --> 00:17:19.140
<i>This is the proper posture...</i>

00:17:19.710 --> 00:17:22.140
<i>This is ballet!</i>

00:17:22.400 --> 00:17:25.890
Squeeze your inner thighs together! 
There's so much space here.

00:17:25.890 --> 00:17:28.770
Old lady, you're touching me too much...

00:17:28.770 --> 00:17:29.900
Your neck!

00:17:33.150 --> 00:17:35.710
Oh, good! You're here!

00:17:35.710 --> 00:17:39.550
You weren't home, so I thought 
maybe you'd gone to Jeet Kune Do.

00:17:39.550 --> 00:17:42.360
<i>This girl's definitely into me!</i>

00:17:43.660 --> 00:17:46.160
Oh, crap! Jeet Kune Do! I gotta go!

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:47.670
Hey, wait.

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:49.290
From now on, come every day.

00:17:49.820 --> 00:17:53.550
You need to be at a certain skill level 
before the dance federation recital.

00:17:55.820 --> 00:17:57.150
Huh? Who said I'd perform in—

00:17:57.150 --> 00:17:58.820
Oh, I'm so happy!

00:17:58.820 --> 00:18:00.690
Let's work hard together, Murao!

00:18:00.690 --> 00:18:03.230
Wh-What's with this ballet studio?

00:18:03.230 --> 00:18:04.630
Is it a dating service?

00:18:07.200 --> 00:18:09.810
Anyway, does this mean...

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:12.040
even now, I...

00:18:12.040 --> 00:18:14.490
could still...

00:18:16.110 --> 00:18:18.460
I'm not performing in that recital thing!

00:18:20.740 --> 00:18:23.260
<i>Crap, something's not right.</i>

00:18:23.260 --> 00:18:25.750
<i>I've got to be cool! Manly!</i>

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:28.250
Looking good today.

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:31.000
Don't get carried away.

00:18:32.060 --> 00:18:34.500
<i>This is fun! It's the best!</i>

00:18:35.410 --> 00:18:41.020
<i>But why don't I feel that "boom!" 
or even that tingle?</i>

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:47.520
Keep your middle finger long, 
and bend your thumb in at the base.

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:51.620
En bas, en avant, à la seconde...

00:18:52.220 --> 00:18:53.840
Keep your elbows up.

00:18:53.840 --> 00:18:55.330
En haut.

00:18:55.330 --> 00:18:57.730
Murao, do you have a question?

00:18:57.730 --> 00:18:59.530
N-No!

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:01.060
Jumpei!

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:03.920
Where are you going?

00:19:03.920 --> 00:19:06.040
Hey, Hyou-chan.

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:10.300
You haven't come to club at all this week.

00:19:10.300 --> 00:19:11.500
You had Jeet Kune Do?

00:19:12.840 --> 00:19:15.210
Murao, you're leaving now, right?

00:19:15.210 --> 00:19:17.900
The teacher said you need 
to get the right clothes—

00:19:19.010 --> 00:19:21.900
Oh, right! Godai-san, 
you're on class duty, right?

00:19:21.900 --> 00:19:24.470
I'll be at club today. Later!

00:19:26.470 --> 00:19:29.230
You're embarrassed about doing ballet.

00:19:29.230 --> 00:19:33.310
Well, I've built this image, y'know...

00:19:33.310 --> 00:19:35.860
You'll be exposed at the ballet festival.

00:19:35.860 --> 00:19:37.090
I told you, I'm not performing.

00:19:37.090 --> 00:19:39.580
What? You go to the studio
 every day, though.

00:19:39.580 --> 00:19:42.740
You're getting free lessons under 
the assumption that you'll perform—

00:19:42.740 --> 00:19:45.650
I-I didn't say anything about performing...

00:19:45.650 --> 00:19:47.450
Anyway, don't tell anyone.

00:19:50.810 --> 00:19:54.460
You know, 'cause I should tell them myself.

00:19:55.260 --> 00:19:56.970
<i>That's what I think, but...</i>

00:19:57.540 --> 00:20:00.430
<i>If they find out I'm doing ballet,</i>

00:20:00.430 --> 00:20:01.820
<i>it'll be all over.</i>

00:20:03.240 --> 00:20:04.930
Hyou-chan, what're you doing?

00:20:04.930 --> 00:20:06.400
Recording a video.

00:20:06.400 --> 00:20:09.430
I'm hoping something funny will happen.

00:20:09.430 --> 00:20:10.230
Huh?

00:20:10.230 --> 00:20:14.150
I've uploaded a bunch of stuff, 
but I'm not getting many views.

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:17.010
I need something funnier.

00:20:17.010 --> 00:20:21.110
That reminds me, summer training 
camp will be August 20th and 21st.

00:20:21.110 --> 00:20:22.290
You're going, right?

00:20:22.290 --> 00:20:23.770
Of course.

00:20:25.230 --> 00:20:28.410
Last year's training camp was fun, anyway.

00:20:29.520 --> 00:20:34.630
But I won't be able to go to
 ballet during that time.

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:39.790
You're late!

00:20:39.790 --> 00:20:41.920
You're not ready for this class,

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:43.680
so go stretch in the corner!

00:20:45.500 --> 00:20:47.760
I'll stretch upstairs...

00:20:50.140 --> 00:20:53.390
<i>There's no way I could 
stretch in that room...</i>

00:20:53.390 --> 00:20:55.400
73rd Suginami 
<b>Ballet Festival</b>

00:20:53.390 --> 00:20:55.400
<b>August 21</b>

00:20:55.400 --> 00:20:58.900
<b>Ballet Festival</b>

00:20:55.400 --> 00:20:58.900
<b>August 21</b>

00:20:55.400 --> 00:20:58.900
<b>Zeneon Suginami Grand Hall</b>

00:20:56.560 --> 00:20:58.140
Same day as our training camp...

00:20:59.720 --> 00:21:03.200
Jumpei, I got a call from Mioka-kun.

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:05.410
He says you're skipping Jeet Kune Do?

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:08.650
But you've been coming home 
late recently. Why is that?

00:21:08.650 --> 00:21:13.410
I-I've got club stuff, and then I go out 
with Hyou-chan and the others...

00:21:13.410 --> 00:21:14.970
Really?

00:21:14.970 --> 00:21:20.880
Jumpei, you told Mioka-kun that you want 
to be a stunt coordinator like your dad?

00:21:20.880 --> 00:21:24.800
Well, I thought it'd be nice 
if I could be one, I guess...

00:21:24.800 --> 00:21:28.800
You can't decide your future 
based on what your dad did.

00:21:29.830 --> 00:21:31.310
Where's this coming from?

00:21:31.630 --> 00:21:36.970
Your dad's head was full 
of martial arts and stunts,

00:21:36.970 --> 00:21:40.570
but it doesn't look like it's 
that way for you at all.

00:21:40.570 --> 00:21:42.190
Huh?

00:21:42.600 --> 00:21:45.000
<i>I thought Mom would be happy...</i>

00:21:45.480 --> 00:21:48.160
<i>that I decided to follow 
in my father's footsteps.</i>

00:21:48.830 --> 00:21:51.570
<i>Dad was so cool, too.</i>

00:21:51.910 --> 00:21:54.910
<b></b>Oikawa Haruka Ballet Company

00:21:51.910 --> 00:21:54.910
Here's a ticket to see the ballet <i>Swan Lake.</i>

00:21:55.280 --> 00:21:58.170
I thought you could do this dance 
with Miyako at the festival.

00:21:58.520 --> 00:21:59.670
You'll be the prince.

00:21:59.670 --> 00:22:00.640
Huh?!

00:22:00.640 --> 00:22:03.760
You can't get here earlier 
like you did before?

00:22:03.760 --> 00:22:06.940
And I'd like to introduce myself to your 
mom, so can I have her phone nu—

00:22:06.940 --> 00:22:09.320
You don't have to! I told her it's club stuff.

00:22:10.240 --> 00:22:12.920
And I'm not gonna dance 
in that ballet festival.

00:22:12.920 --> 00:22:15.600
It's during my soccer training camp.

00:22:15.600 --> 00:22:16.560
Oh?

00:22:16.840 --> 00:22:18.930
Then quit soccer.

00:22:18.930 --> 00:22:19.680
Huh?!

00:22:19.680 --> 00:22:23.360
Soccer will make you build muscles you 
don't need, and it'll be tough later.

00:22:23.360 --> 00:22:25.020
Besides, you don't need big muscles.

00:22:25.020 --> 00:22:27.870
What?! I'm talking about my club! 
It's an official school activity—

00:22:27.870 --> 00:22:29.700
Yeah? So what?

00:22:30.560 --> 00:22:34.540
You're going to become 
a ballet dancer, right?

00:22:39.790 --> 00:22:41.130
What are you saying?

00:22:41.130 --> 00:22:44.150
Are you crazy, old lady?!

00:22:44.150 --> 00:22:49.560
I told you! I have my club, and my friends, 
and Jeet Kune Do, and my family...

00:22:50.160 --> 00:22:51.430
And...

00:23:02.200 --> 00:23:04.020
Stop! Stop it, old lady!

00:23:04.020 --> 00:23:04.940
Stop what?

00:23:05.690 --> 00:23:07.330
Though, of course...

00:23:07.900 --> 00:23:11.880
It's only if you can throw 
everything else away.

00:23:19.000 --> 00:23:20.170
Luou-kun?

00:23:22.140 --> 00:23:24.380
There's a new student.

00:23:24.380 --> 00:23:26.750
A boy in the same class as Miyako.

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:30.880
He might be more talented than you.

00:23:34.890 --> 00:23:35.890
<b><i>Preview</i></b>

00:23:36.410 --> 00:23:39.220
What's up with this guy? 
Is he looking down on me?!

00:23:39.220 --> 00:23:42.560
And his arm's around her
 shoulder all of a sudden!

00:23:42.560 --> 00:23:48.280
<i>Dance Dance Danseur,</i> Act 2: 
"He's... the Type I Can't Be Friends With!"

00:23:45.060 --> 00:23:49.900
Act 2
 "He's... the Type I Can't Be Friends With!"
